selfCheck folder;aplv;linux;mac;sel;v
⍝ Validate runtime setup and report selected DuckDB library for current platform.
⍝ folder:
⍝   - ''     : report current state (initializes with 'lib/' if needed)
⍝   - 'lib/' : initialize first, then report

:If 0<≢folder
    init folder
:ElseIf 0=⎕NC'ducklibpath'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

aplv←⊃('.'⎕WG'APLVersion')
linux←∨/'Linux'⍷aplv
mac←(∨/'Darwin'⍷aplv)∨/'Mac'⍷aplv
sel←('windows' 'linux' 'mac')⊃⍨1+linux+2×mac
v←version ⍬

⎕←'DuckDB self-check'
⎕←'OS: ',sel
⎕←'Library: ',ducklibpath
⎕←'Version: ',v
⎕←'Vector size: ',⍕STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE
